### Terraform ###

# Local Terraform working directories
**/.terraform/*

# Terraform state
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Saved Terraform plans
*.tfplan

# Local variable files - may contain environment-specific/sensitive values
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Terraform crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Keep the provider lock file in Git
!.terraform.lock.hcl

# Terraform generated review/debug artifacts
dependency-graph.dot
*-plan.txt
*tfplan